	"Description": "[center][size=4][font=Georgia]\uFEFF\uFEFF❀\u00A0[/font][font=Georgia]Seasonal Open Windows\uFEFF\u00A0\uFEFF\uFEFF❀\uFEFF[/font][/size][/center][center][font=Georgia][size=2]by orangeblossom[/size][/font][/center][font=Georgia]\n<br />[size=2]Updated using the new features in SDV 1.6. These windows are now standalone.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=2][u]How to find:[/u]\n<br />   \uFEFF1. Buy the [b]furniture catalogue[/b] from Robin's shop; or\n<br />   \uFEFF2. Use [b]CJB Item Spawner[/b].[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=2][u]Furniture List:\n<br />[/u]   \uFEFF❀\u00A01-tile window:\u00A0\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF1.\u00A0[/size][/font][size=2][i][font=Georgia]Open Window {{color}}[/font][/i][font=Georgia]\n<br />[/font][font=Georgia]   \n<br />   \uFEFF\uFEFF❀\u00A0\uFEFF2-tile window:\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF1.\u00A0[i]Open Window 2TL\u00A0[/i][/font][i][font=Georgia]{{color}}\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF[/font][/i][font=Georgia][i]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF2.\u00A0[/i][i]Open Window 2TR\u00A0[i][font=Georgia]{{color}}[/font][/i][/i]\n<br />[/font]   \n<br />   \uFEFF\uFEFF❀\u00A0[font=Georgia]3-tile window:\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF1.\u00A0[i]Open Window 3TL\u00A0[/i][/font][i][font=Georgia]{{color}}\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF[/font][/i][font=Georgia][i]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF2.\u00A0[/i][i]Open Window 3TC\u00A0[i][font=Georgia]{{color}}\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF[/font][/i]3.\u00A0[/i][i]Open Window 3TR\u00A0[i][font=Georgia]{{color}}[/font][/i][/i][/font][i]\n<br />[/i][font=Georgia]\n<br />[u]Available wood colors:\n<br />[/u]   \uFEFF\uFEFF❀ Birch\n<br />   \uFEFF\uFEFF❀ Light Brown\n<br />   \uFEFF\uFEFF❀ Brown\u00A0\n<br />   \uFEFF[/font]❀[font=Georgia] Dark Brown\n<br />   \uFEFF❀ Black[/font][/size][font=Georgia]\n<br />\n<br />[i][size=3][b]NOTE:\u00A0[/b]I separated the files by color so you can [u]pick and choose[/u] which one you want in your game. [u]You can[/u] also [u]add all versions in your game[/u] and they won't conflict with each other.\n<br />\n<br />[/size][/i]extra notes: make sure you're on [b]sdv 1.6[/b] and keep [b]smapi[/b] and [b]content patcher[/b] updated for 1.6[/font]",
